  UNDERPOWERED — m3probe's positive control (the object in `vision`, per neuron) reads 0.840,
  under the 0.850 this instrument needs. That row is KNOWN to carry
  the signal, so every null above is a fact about the instrument and
  not about the creature. Both sweeps read every module downstream of this one.

  --- eligprobe, 600000 ticks x 3 creatures ---
